{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38277","headline":"代小玉家爲蕃骑所虏後寄故集贤裴公相国 · 韩偓","name":"代小玉家爲蕃骑所虏後寄故集贤裴公相国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动天金鼓逼神州，惜别无心学坠楼。\n不得回眸辞傅粉，便须含泪对残秋。\n折钗伴妾埋青冢，半镜随郎葬杜邮。\n唯有此宵魂梦里，殷勤见觅凤池头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}